    "title": "Merzouga vs Zagora: Which Sahara Desert Tour Is Right for You?",
    "seotitle": "Merzouga vs Zagora: Which Sahara Tour to Choose",
    "seodescription": "Merzouga vs Zagora: compare drive times, dune scenery, and camp quality to decide which Sahara desert tour from Marrakech fits your trip best.",
    "seokeywords": "Merzouga vs Zagora, Erg Chebbi vs Erg Chigaga, closest desert to Marrakech, which Sahara dunes to visit",
